{"type":"message","id":"97931ae4","parentId":"12cdec61","timestamp":"2026-02-18T16:29:49.634Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Fourth skill: osint-search-multi. This is the orchestrator skill that can search multiple sources (web, YouTube, social) and aggregate results with deduplication. It should be able to combine results from osint-crawl, osint-analyze, and osint-youtube, and potentially other sources in the future.\n\nI'll design it as an orchestrator that can:\n- Accept a query\n- Call multiple search methods (web, youtube, etc.)\n- Deduplicate results\n- Return aggregated, sorted results\n\nI'll make it extensible so other skills can be added later.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Now creating the fourth and final skill: **osint-search-multi** - the orchestrator."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_249f020bc9374504bdf84a7b","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"{\n  \"name\": \"osint-search-multi\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"Multi-source OSINT orchestrator with deduplication and aggregation\",\n  \"main\": \"index.js\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"start\": \"node index.js\",\n    \"test\": \"node test.js\"\n  },\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"osint\",\n    \"search\",\n    \"orchestrator\",\n    \"aggregate\",\n    \"openclaw\"\n  ],\n  \"author\": \"OSINT Toolkit\",\n  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"node-fetch\": \"^3.3.2\"\n  }\n}","file_path":"skills/osint-search-multi/package.json"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":20109,"output":469,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20578,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771432182859}}
