tle\": \"Cybersecurity Trends 2025\",\n      \"description\": \"Top cybersecurity threats and solutions for modern enterprises.\",\n      \"content\": \"Cybersecurity remains a critical concern for organizations worldwide. Recent trends show increasing sophistication in ransomware attacks. AI-powered security tools are becoming essential for threat detection. Zero-trust architecture is gaining adoption. Supply chain security is also a growing focus area. Security professionals must stay updated with the latest threats and defense mechanisms.\",\n      \"wordCount\": 62\n    }\n  ]\n}","file_path":"skills/osint-analyze/sample-data.json"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":27806,"output":562,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28368,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771432298457}}
