{"type":"message","id":"33929c86","parentId":"5916059d","timestamp":"2026-02-18T16:32:10.727Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good! Now let me check if the osint-crawl skill has any issues. The dependencies look fine. Let me also verify the test.js for osint-crawl to make sure it's comprehensive.\n\nActually, I should also create a consistent README structure across all skills and ensure they're complete. Let me quickly read all READMEs to make sure they're properly formatted.\n\nBut I think they're all good. Let me now create a final verification script that can be run to check all skills are properly set up.\n\nActually, let me also add a top-level setup script that installs all dependencies at once.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me create a convenience setup script and verification script."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_dd0b28a2307949c5a36b2b15","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"#!/usr/bin/env node\n\n/**\n * OSINT Toolkit Setup Script\n * Installs dependencies for all skills\n */\n\nconst { execSync } = require('child_process');\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst path = require('path');\n\nconst skills = ['osint-crawl', 'osint-analyze', 'osint-youtube', 'osint-search-multi'];\nconst skillsDir = path.join(__dirname, 'skills');\n\nconsole.log('🔧 OSINT Toolkit Setup\\n');\nconsole.log('Installing dependencies for all skills...\\n');\n\nlet hasErrors = false;\n\nskills.forEach(skill => {\n  const skillPath = path.join(skillsDir, skill);\n  try {\n    if (!fs.existsSync(skillPath)) {\n      console.log(`⚠️  Skill directory not found: ${skill}`);\n      return;\n    }\n\n    console.log(`📦 Installing ${skill}...`);\n    process.chdir(skillPath);\n    execSync('npm install', { stdio: 'pipe' });\n    console.log(`✓ ${skill} installed\\n`);\n  } catch (error) {\n    hasErrors = true;\n    console.log(`✗ ${skill} failed: ${error.message}\\n`);\n  }\n});\n\nprocess.chdir(__dirname);\n\nif (hasErrors) {\n  console.log('\\n⚠️  Some installations failed. Check the errors above.');\n  console.log('Make sure Node.js (v18+) and npm are installed.\\n');\n} else {\n  console.log('\\n✅ All dependencies installed!');\n  console.log('\\nNext steps:');\n  console.log('1. Set YOUTUBE_API_KEY environment variable for YouTube searches');\n  console.log('2. Run tests: npm test (in each skill directory)');\n  console.log('3. Integrate into openclaw.json (see skills/README.md)\\n');\n}","file_path":"skills/setup.js"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":29200,"output":707,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29907,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771432319561}}
