{"type":"message","id":"1365f4ed","parentId":"2d2369fe","timestamp":"2026-02-18T16:33:12.100Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! Now I have a complete toolkit. Let me create a quick summary of what was built and verify all files are in place. I should also check if there's any need for an openclaw.json template or integration instruction.\n\nActually, the master README already includes integration instructions. I think I'm done!\n\nLet me now prepare a final status report for the user. I should list:\n\n1. All four skills created\n2. Each skill has: package.json, index.js, test.js, README.md\n3. Additional files: setup.js, verify.js, demo.js, index.js, sample-data.json\n4. Master README at skills/README.md\n\nI should also note any considerations:\n- YouTube requires API key\n- Node.js v18+ recommended\n- Installation needed\n- Dedicated test files included\n- All skills are ready for OpenClaw integration\n\nLet me also double-check that I didn't miss anything from the requirements:\n- \"Each skill should have its own directory under `skills/`\" ✓\n- \"with package.json, main file, README.md\" ✓\n- \"Include example usage and test data\" ✓\n- \"Ready for integration via `skills.entries` in openclaw.json\" ✓\n- \"Deliver a comprehensive README at `skills/README.md`\" ✓\n- \"Work step-by-step; report progress and any blockers\" ✓\n\nAll requirements met! Let me now provide the final completion report.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Let me verify the final directory structure."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1b09fad6f66942a49099d61a","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"tree skills /F 2>nul || dir skills /B"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":32808,"output":691,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33499,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":17